    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=8.56\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*} A_{\\text{cylinder}}&=2\\pi r^2+2\\pi rh\\\\ A_{\\text{cylinder}}&=2\\pi(5)^2+2\\pi(5)(9)\\\\ A_{\\text{cylinder}}&=140\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\\\ 6x^2&=140\\pi\\\\ x^2&=\\frac{70\\pi}{3}\\\\ x&=\\sqrt{\\frac{70\\pi}{3}}\\\\ x&=8.56\\text{ cm}\\quad\\text{(2 d.p.)}\\end{align*}$$",
